# The Heraldry of {{TEMPLE_TITLE}}

<!-- USER DATA — never overwritten by a Gaia engine upgrade.
     Amended by re-interview (/gaia) or deliberate human edit. -->

The explicit standard for how this temple's work is announced: commit
messages, PR descriptions, changelogs, attribution. The Herald
({{GOD_HERALD}}) composes from this codex — never from inferred taste. Where
an organization forces a standard, it is written here and it is law; where the
developer has a preference, it is written here and it is consistent.

Precedence: a repository's calibration profile may record **deviations** from
this codex (an org repo with its own commit convention, say). A recorded
deviation wins for that repository; everything not deviated follows this file.

